# Project Structure

Maintain a clean project structure.

## Packages

presentation/

- ui
- state
- intent
- effect
- viewmodel

domain/

- model
- repository
- usecase

data/

- repository
- datasource
- local
- remote
- mapper

di/

utils/

## Rules

Keep related files together.

Avoid giant classes.

Prefer feature-based organisation.

Reuse existing utilities before creating new ones.

Keep naming consistent.